Rem AMCAF Blitter Clear, Fill, Busy, Wait (the golden is the original's)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen Open 1,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Screen 0
Print #1,"busy";Blitter Busy
Blitter Wait
Print #1,"busy2";Blitter Busy
Ink 3 : Box 10,10 To 60,40 : Box 100,50 To 140,90 : Draw 20,100 To 70,150 : Draw 70,150 To 20,180
Ink 15 : Plot 5,5 : Plot 300,150
DUMP
Blitter Fill 0,0
DUMP
Screen 1
Blitter Fill 0,1,0,0,320,200 To 1,0
DUMP
Blitter Fill 0,0,16,20,112,100
DUMP
Blitter Fill 0,1,5,5,100,100 To 1,3
DUMP
Blitter Clear 0,0,32,30 To 96,60
DUMP
Blitter Clear 0,1
DUMP
Blitter Clear 1,0,0,0 To 16,3
DUMP
Blitter Fill 0,0,0,0,0,50
Blitter Fill 0,0,50,50,40,50
Blitter Clear 0,0,50,50 To 50,50
Print #1,"empty"
DUMP
Blitter Copy Limit 0
Blitter Copy Limit 8,16 To 70,40
Print #1,"limit"
Print #1,"end"
Procedure DUMP
 Blitter Wait
 For P=0 To 3
 For Y=0 To 199 Step 7
 C=0
 For X=0 To 38 Step 2
 C=C+Deek(Logbase(P)+Y*40+X)*(X+1)
 Next X
 Print #1,Y;" ";C;
 Next Y
 Print #1,""
 Next P
End Proc
